CancelByAProofSetTest
├── when a satisfying set cancels the attempt
│   └── it should end the attempt, keep the setup and leave the next recovery a fresh id and wait
├── when the cancellation arrives after the spend
│   └── it should revert
├── when the cancelling set leans on a stopped method
│   ├── it should revert
│   └── it should accept the same cancellation after the lift
└── when the cancellation names another attempt
    └── it should revert
